+	// LINEAGE PROBE: which prefix a CONTRACT key hangs off. "module" (the
+	// default for every new catalog major): the complete ModulePath, so two
+	// majors of one catalog never share a contract key. "registry": the
+	// major-free RegistryPath, the pre-change shape, kept ONLY so an already
+	// published major (opm@v4) keeps its keys for its remaining releases.
+	ContractScope: *"module" | "registry"
